Subject: Cantor Phase3 Inventory Consistency Evidence Revision Semantic Refinement

Description: Independent term, clause, role, and inference audit of the preserved source and exploded requirements. It fixes the intended meaning of evidence, consistency, equality, repetition, non-atomicity, quiescence, snapshot, receipt, producer, and validator before canonicalization.

